# Angel One

> Angel One Limited (formerly Angel Broking Limited) is one of India's largest and most trusted retail stockbroking and wealth management platforms. Founded in 1987, Angel One offers a fully digital, super-app experience for trading and investing across equities, derivatives, commodities, currencies, mutual funds, IPOs, ETFs, US stocks, digital gold, bonds, fixed deposits, insurance, and NPS.

> Angel One operates under strict regulatory oversight by SEBI, IRDAI, PFRDA, and AMFI. All products and services are offered through licensed entities as described below.

